  "notes": {
    "m1": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "text": "Motion — one curve everywhere: cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.1,1). Load: wordmark lines rise from a mask (1.2s, 80ms stagger), hero image unmasks top to bottom. Project hover: 1.035 scale inside a fixed crop + title underline draws in. Index to project: the clicked image FLIP-expands into the project hero, title cross-fades. Next project: the preview image scales to full-bleed and becomes the next hero. Statement: words shift from grey to ink as they cross 60% of the viewport. Reduced motion: no transforms, 150ms opacity only.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 6080,
      "y": 4520
    },
    "m2": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "text": "Mobile nav — the bar stays 56px. 'Menu' opens a full-screen ink sheet (clip-path from top, 600ms), links rise in sequence. The current page carries the accent dot. Close is the same button, relabelled.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 6550,
      "y": 960
    },
    "m3": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "text": "Touch replacement for the desktop hover-preview: every row carries its own thumbnail; filters become a horizontally scrolling text row. Rows are 72px+ tall.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 7020,
      "y": 2120
    },
